-- A closing tag whose name is not its element's, and not an element's
-- further out, is mismatched_closing_tag, naming both, and is taken as the
-- closer (frontend.md §9.5): one mistake, one message (6:14), and the
-- siblings after it and the outer closer parse as written.
view =
    <div><p>a</span><p>b</p></div>
